    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a multi-copy, single-paste utility tool designed to streamline your workflow. It allows users to copy text, images, or screenshots via <strong>Ctrl+C</strong>, right-click copy, or other methods, while the software records all copied content. When you need to paste multiple copied items in sequence, simply press <strong>Ctrl+\\</strong> (either left/right <strong>Ctrl</strong> key + <strong>\\</strong>,\u00a0 \\ is the key above <strong>Enter</strong>) to paste stored content in recorded order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong><br>\u25c6 <strong>Clipboard History Timeline</strong><br>A row of small dots at the bottom visually represents your clipboard history. The <strong>purple dot</strong> indicates the current position for pasting. Click any dot to start pasting from that specific entry, and the dot will turn to purple (e.g., skip earlier items).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Enhanced Pasting</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ctrl+\\</strong>: Pastes stored items <strong>sequentially</strong> from your chosen starting point.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ctrl+V</strong>: Pastes the <strong>latest copied item</strong> (default shortcut won't be blocked).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Customizable Cartoon Companion</strong><br>Interact with the &quot;Copy-Paste Girl&quot; character:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust her size via <strong>mouse wheel scroll</strong> or <strong>touchpad gestures</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag her freely to any screen position.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replace her appearance by modifying <strong>image.png</strong> in the root folder.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Lightweight &amp; Flexible Control</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pause/Resume</strong>: Click the <strong>Pause button</strong> to temporarily stop recording new clipboard content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Instant Reset</strong>: Press the <strong>R button</strong> to clear all stored history (all dots will be cleaned) and reset the software.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal system resource usage \u2013 runs quietly and acts as a cute desktop pet with minimal computer hardware  requirements and minimal resource consumption.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734020/extras/ff0c500c0ec0944b469d0e25ef0e0a13.poster.avif?t=1751887045\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734020/extras/ff0c500c0ec0944b469d0e25ef0e0a13.webm?t=1751887045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
