/Resume</strong>: Click the <strong>Pause button</strong> to temporarily stop recording new clipboard content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Instant Reset</strong>: Press the <strong>R button</strong> to clear all stored history (all dots will be cleaned) and reset the software.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal system resource usage \u2013 runs quietly and acts as a cute desktop pet with minimal computer hardware  requirements and minimal resource consumption.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734020/extras/ff0c500c0ec0944b469d0e25ef0e0a13.poster.avif?t=1751887045\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734020/extras/ff0c500c0ec0944b469d0e25ef0e0a13.webm?t=1751887045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
